e,bash]","+DataWeave scripts are detected in two ways:","+","+- **By file extension**: any resource ending in `.dwl` (e.g., `resource:classpath:transform.dwl`)","+- **By content**: inline expressions starting with the `%dw` header","+","+Once detected, the script is transpiled to DataSonnet and executed via the datasonnet-mapper runtime.","+The conversion happens once at route initialization, so there is no runtime overhead.","+","+=== Example","+","+Given a DataWeave file `transform.dwl` on the classpath:","+","+[source,dataweave]"," ----","-camel transform dataweave -e \"payload.name ++ ' ' ++ payload.surname\"","+%dw 2.0","+output application/json","+---","+{","+    orderId: payload.order_id,","+    customer: payload.customer.first_name ++ \" \" ++ payload.customer.last_name,","+    total: payload.items map ((item) -> item.price * item.qty)","+                         reduce ((item, acc = 0) -> acc + item)","+}"," ----"," ","-=== Converting a file or directory","+You can use it directly in a route:","+","+[tabs]","+====","+Java::","++","+[source,java]","+----","+from(\"direct:in\")","+    .transform(datasonnet(\"resource:classpath:transform.dwl\", String.class))","+    .to(\"mock:result\");","+----","+","+XML::","++","+[source,xml]","+----","+<route>","+    <from uri=\"direct:in\"/>","+    <transform>","+        <datasonnet resultTypeName=\"java.lang.String\">resource:classpath:transform.dwl</datasonnet>","+    </transform>","+    <to uri=\"mock:result\"/>","+</route>","+----","+","+YAML::","++","+[source,yaml]","+----","+- route:","+    from:","+      uri: direct:in","+      steps:","+        - transform:","+            expression:","+              datasonnet:","+                expression: \"resource:classpath:transform.dwl\"","+                resultType: java.lang.String","+        - to:","+            uri: mock:result","+----","+====","+","+=== CLI Transpiler","+","+You can also convert DataWeave scripts ahead of time using the Camel CLI:"," "," [source,bash]"," ----","+camel transform dataweave -e \"payload.name ++ ' ' ++ payload.surname\""," camel transform dataweave --input my-transform.dwl --output my-transform.ds"," camel transform dataweave --input src/main/resources/dwl/ --output src/main/resources/ds/"," ----"," ","+=== Supported Constructs","+"," The transpiler automatically maps DataWeave constructs to their DataSonnet equivalents, including:"," "," - `payload` to `body`, `vars` to `cml.variable()`, `attributes.headers` to `cml.header()`","@@ -431,7 +501,7 @@ The transpiler automatically maps DataWeave constructs to their DataSonnet equiv"," - String operations: `contains`, `startsWith`, `endsWith`, `splitBy`, `joinBy`, `replace`"," - Functions: `sizeOf`, `upper`, `lower`, `trim`, `now`, `uuid`, `abs`, `round`, `sqrt`"," ","-Constructs that cannot be automatically converted (such as `match` expressions) are marked with `TODO` comments in the output for manual review.","+Constructs that cannot be automatically converted (such as `match` expressions) are emitted as `null` for manual review."," "," == Dependencies"," "],"additions":77,"deletions":7,"truncated":false},{"path":"catalog/camel-catalog/src/generated/resources/org/apache/camel/catalog/others.properties","lines":["@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@ cluster"," componentdsl"," console"," csimple-joor","+dataweave"," debug"," diagram"," dsl-modeline"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"catalog/camel-catalog/src/generated/resources/org/apache/camel/catalog/others/dataweave.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@","+{","+  \"other\": {","+    \"kind\": \"other\",","+    \"name\": \"dataweave\",","+    \"title\": \"DataWeave\",","+    \"description\": \"Camel DataWeave support\",","+    \"deprecated\": false,","+    \"firstVersion\": \"4.22.0\",","+    \"label\": \"transformation\",","+    \"supportLevel\": \"Preview\",","+    \"groupId\": \"org.apache.camel\",","+    \"artifactId\": \"camel-dataweave\",","+    \"version\": \"4.22.0-SNAPSHOT\"","+  }","+}"],"addi